{"id":"df2a9108-8973-499a-9b04-d52c58d75c81","createdAt":"2026-10-27T06:07:57.309Z","batchId":"onboarding_glm-5-3-flash-boundless-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-boundless-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .steps{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px}\n  .step-dot{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--border,#8884);color:var(--muted,#888);flex-shrink:0}\n  .step-dot.active{border-color:var(--primary,#6366f1);color:var(--primary,#6366f1)}\n  .step-dot.done{background:var(--primary,#6366f1);border-color:var(--primary,#6366f1);color:#fff}\n  .step-line{flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--border,#8884)}\n  .step-label{font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted,#888)}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\" style=\"max-width:640px\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Welcome aboard 👋</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Set up your workspace in under two minutes. You can change everything later.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"steps\" id=\"stepper\">\n        <div class=\"center\">\n          <div class=\"step-dot\" data-step=\"1\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"step-label\">Account</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"center\">\n          <div class=\"step-dot\" data-step=\"2\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"step-label\">Preferences</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"center\">\n          <div class=\"step-dot\" data-step=\"3\">✓</div>\n          <div class=\"step-label\">Done</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" style=\"width:33%;transition:width .3s\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 1: Account -->\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"step1\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Create your account</div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Tell us who you are. Your email is used for sign-in only — we never share it.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Amara Okafor\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Work email\n          <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"amara@acme.dev\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Password\n          <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"8+ characters\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Subscribe to product updates and release notes</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> I agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy</label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 2: Preferences -->\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"step2\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Tune your experience</div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">We'll use these to tailor your dashboard and notifications.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <label>Primary role\n          <select>\n            <option>Product manager</option>\n            <option>Engineer</option>\n            <option>Designer</option>\n            <option>Founder / executive</option>\n            <option>Other</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Team size\n          <select>\n            <option>Just me</option>\n            <option selected>2–10 people</option>\n            <option>11–50 people</option>\n            <option>51+ people</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Theme\n          <select>\n            <option>Follow system</option>\n            <option>Light</option>\n            <option>Dark</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Notifications</span>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Weekly digest email</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Mention and comment alerts</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Milestone reminders</label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 3: Done -->\n    <div class=\"card center\" id=\"step3\" hidden>\n      <div style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1\">🎉</div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">You're all set, Amara!</div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"max-width:420px\">Your workspace is ready. Here's a quick summary of your configuration — you can adjust any of it from Settings at any time.</p>\n      <table>\n        <tr><td>Plan</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge\">Free trial · 14 days left</span></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Role</td><td class=\"num\">Product manager</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Team size</td><td class=\"num\">2–10 people</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Theme</td><td class=\"num\">Follow system</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weekly digest</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge-secondary\">On</span></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Comment alerts</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge-secondary\">On</span></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"backBtn\" disabled>← Back</button>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Step <span id=\"stepNum\">1</span> of 3</span>\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"nextBtn\">Continue →</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted center\">Already have an account? <a href=\"#\">Sign in instead</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  let step = 1;\n  const back = document.getElementById('backBtn'),\n        next = document.getElementById('nextBtn'),\n        num = document.getElementById('stepNum'),\n        bar = document.getElementById('bar');\n  function render(){\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++){\n      document.getElementById('step'+i).hidden = i !== step;\n      const dot = document.querySelector('.step-dot[data-step=\"'+i+'\"]');\n      dot.classList.toggle('active', i === step);\n      dot.classList.toggle('done', i < step || (i === 3 && step === 3));\n      dot.textContent = i < step || (i === 3 && step === 3) ? '✓' : i;\n    }\n    num.textContent = step;\n    bar.style.width = (step / 3 * 100) + '%';\n    back.disabled = step === 1;\n    next.textContent = step === 2 ? 'Finish ✓' : step === 3 ? 'Go to dashboard →' : 'Continue →';\n    next.textContent = step === 1 ? 'Continue →' : next.textContent;\n  }\n  next.onclick = () => { if (step < 3) step++; else next.textContent = 'Taking you to your dashboard…'; render(); };\n  back.onclick = () => { if (step > 1) step--; render(); };\n  render();\n</script>","deltas":[[1036,"<style"],[1049,">\n  ."],[1080,"steps{"],[1081,"display:flex;align"],[1090,"-items:center;gap:12"],[1107,"px;margin-bottom"],[1118,":32"],[1132,"px}\n  .step-dot"],[1222,"{width"],[1222,":34px;height:34"],[1222,"px;border-radius:50%;"],[1222,"display:flex;align-items:center"],[1223,";justify-content:center;font"],[1223,"-weight:600;border"],[1226,":2"],[1237,"px solid var(--border"],[1251,",#888"],[1266,"4"],[1278,");color"],[1291,":var(--m"],[1306,"uted,#888);flex"],[1320,"-shrink:0}\n "],[1341," .step-dot.active{border"],[1345,"-color:var(--primary"],[1358,",#6"],[1371,"366f1);color"],[1388,":var(--primary,#"],[1404,"6366f1)}\n"],[1413,"  .step-dot.done{"],[1427,"background:var(--pr